  "invariants": [
    "Each component has one Lens key wherever it appears; no level redraws a component from another level with a new identity.",
    "Every edge keeps its direction and relation at every level it is shown (Retrieval reads the Vector store, never the reverse).",
    "L1 edges that cross the system boundary roll up to the L0 edge they are part of (Orchestrator → Model Gateway is part of Helpdesk Answers → model provider).",
    "A node with no detail in the source (Ingestion worker, Reranker) has no child level and no code evidence; the gap is explained, not filled.",
    "L5 shows only locations the source states, never code the source does not contain.",
    "Every Lens node maps to one canonical canvas element; Lens holds no fact that is not on the canvas."
  ],
  "interactions": [
